Error [jet.UnknownType]: `Severity.reflect().range` is a fact value, not a type
  --> tests/ui/fact_read_type_position.jet:3:18
    |
  3 | takes: fn(value: Severity.reflect().range) {}
    |                  ^^^^^^^^
 Why: Facts classify values at compile time; they do not mint or select types
 Fix: Read the fact in a compile-time value position instead
